 "description": "Public modeled field-service price estimate with cited BLS wage benchmarks. Returns customer hourly rates, line items, ranges and a total alongside geographic scope and source provenance. Model estimates are not observed transaction prices or binding quotes. Use dispatch.quote with an accepted credential to request a quote. No API key required.",
